WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.710
Before writing a pivot complete one sentence one
output row represents what Once

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:13.033
the row meaning is clear identify which category
values should become columns Then

00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:18.831
identify the measure that belongs in each cell
Finally ask whether several

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:24.749
source rows can map to the same cell If they can you
need an aggregation

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:25.131
rule
